Abstract = {In this paper, we introduce two new functionals within the context of
   the variational grid generation problem: an area functional and a
   smoothness functional. Both of them are based on an improved adaptive
   algorithm which focuses on the most folded grid cells. It is shown that
   when they are minimized in order to generate smooth and convex grids on
   irregular planar regions the optimization process converges notably
   faster than it does with other functionals previously reported.},
