   (ECS), Elect \& Photon Div},
Abstract = {The synthesis of LaxAl2-xO3 films using ultrasonic spray pyrolysis
   technique are reported. The films were deposited from a spraying
   solution of aluminum acetylacetonate (Al(acac)(3)) and lanthanum(III)
   nitrate hexahydrate La(NO3)(3)6H(2)O dissolved in N,N-Dimethylformamide
   on (100) Si substrates. The substrate temperature during was in the
   range 500-600 degrees C. The mean roughness was lower than 18 angstrom
   in all cases. The films were amorphous in all cases. The optical band
   gap was 5.42 eV and the refractive index was in the 1.64-1.72 range
   depending of the deposition conditions.},
