   DOE},
Abstract = {We present a new adaptive-harmonic structured grid generation method. It
   is based on a functional that shares a common set of minimizers with
   Ivanenko's harmonic functional {[}A.A. Charakhch'yan, S.A. Ivanenko,
   Curvilinear grids of convex quadrilaterals, Comput. Maths. Math. Phys.
   28(2) (1988) 126-133.]. An unconstrained optimization process related to
   a continuation parameter is used to guarantee the convexity of the grid
   cells. Several numerical examples of grids generated on quite irregular
   2Dregions, show the effective performance of the proposed method and its
   robustness when preset monitor functions are, given. (C) 2007 IMACS.
