Pages = {104-119},
Month = {DEC},
Abstract = {The present work is intended to be a general reference for students and
   professionals interested in the field. Here. we present an introduction
   to the analysis techniques and fundamental principles for data
   processing and operation of a typical ion accelerator that operates in
   the low energy range. We also present a detailed description of the
   apparatus and propose new analysis methods for the results. In addition,
   we introduce illustrative simulations of the ion's trajectories in the
   different components of the apparatus performed with specialized
   software and, a new computer data acquisition and control interface.},
