   using density functional theory (DFT) with two different approximations:
   the hybrid-B3LYP and GGA-BP86. The normal modes of vibration obtained
   were classified according to the irreducible representations of the T-d
   group. The calculated vibrational frequencies were tabulated to be
   compared with experimental data when they became available.},
